				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">Standard installations typically take 1–2 days; installations requiring new ductwork or a zoning system can take 3–5 days depending on scope. New equipment includes manufacturer warranties covering parts for 5–10 years, and we register the warranty and walk you through the coverage.</div>
